[2026-03-14T20:50:18.562Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018KMGN6z8saad9DdhyhZbL5","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Here's a summary of the main UI elements and data-testid attributes for both pages:\n\n## SearchPage.tsx\n\n**Main data-testid attributes:**\n- `search-page` - Root container\n- `search-form` - Main form wrapper\n- `swap-airports-button` - Button to swap origin/destination\n- Components accept `testIdPrefix` props that generate:\n  - `origin-input`, `origin-button`, `origin-results` (AirportAutocomplete for origin)\n  - `destination-input`, `destination-button`, `destination-results` (AirportAutocomplete for destination)\n  - `departure-date-input`, `departure-date-picker` (DatePicker for departure)\n  - `return-date-input`, `return-date-picker` (DatePicker for return, when round trip)\n\n**UI Structure:**\n- Trip type, passenger count, cabin class selectors at top\n- Origin/destination airports with swap button\n- Departure and return dates (return only for round trips)\n- Search button\n- RecentSearches and PopularDestinations sections below\n\n## PopularDestinations Component\n\n**Key data-testid attributes:**\n- `popular-destinations` - Root container\n- `popular-destinations-grid` - Grid wrapper\n- `popular-dest-{IATA_CODE}` - Individual destination card button (e.g., `popular-dest-NYC`)\n- `popular-dest-price-{IATA_CODE}` - Price display for each destination\n\n**Structure:** Grid of clickable cards showing city, country, and min_price, with gradient backgrounds. Displays skeleton loaders while fetching.\n\n## ExplorePage.tsx\n\n**Main data-testid attributes:**\n- `explore-page` - Root container\n- `explore-origin-selector` - Origin selection section\n- Components use `testIdPrefix=\"explore-origin\"` for airport autocomplete\n\n**Three main sections:**\n1. DestinationMap\n2. FlexibleDatesGrid\n3. DealsSection\n\n## DestinationMap Component\n\n**Key data-testid attributes:**\n- `destination-map` - Root container\n- `destination-map-controls` - Control buttons wrapper\n- `destination-map-zoom-in`, `destination-map-zoom-out`, `destination-map-reset` - Zoom controls\n- `destination-map-svg` - SVG canvas\n- `destination-map-loading` - Loading state\n- `destination-marker-{IATA_CODE}` - Individual destination marker\n- `destination-tooltip-{IATA_CODE}` - Tooltip shown on hover\n- `destination-map-empty` - Empty state message\n\n## DealsSection Component\n\n**Key data-testid attributes:**\n- `deals-section` - Root container\n- `deals-loading` - Loading state container\n- `deals-empty` - Empty state message\n- `deals-grid` - Grid of deal cards\n- `deal-card-{DESTINATION_CODE}` - Individual deal card\n- `deal-dates-{DESTINATION_CODE}` - Date range for each deal\n- `deal-price-{DESTINATION_CODE}` - Price display\n- `deal-savings-{DESTINATION_CODE}` - Savings percentage (when applicable)\n\nFor your deployment test, I'd recommend:\n1. **Real data verification:** Check `popular-destinations-grid` contains cards with `popular-dest-*` testids\n2. **Write operation test:** Navigate to SearchPage, fill the search form (origin, destination, dates), and click the search button to simulate a complete search workflow"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a2a2c79ef3363ac5c (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 27968\ntool_uses: 9\nduration_ms: 11768</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"17b27623-7930-4e57-8201-63e9edf08d5d","uuid":"6041bbf7-b03e-490d-a6e1-d0f17b2d32bf","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Quick exploration: In /repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/SearchPage.tsx, what UI elements are rendered? What data-testid attributes are used? Also check what the popular-destinations component looks like and what data-testid it uses. Also look at /repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/ExplorePage.tsx. I need to understand what the main pages display so I can write a deployment test that verifie